{"title":"Lexicographic ordering","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>Lexicographic (or dictionary ordering) is a strict total ordering <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/2/262a080d0d87e973b817945967a512346d8bfc49.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$&lt;$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> on the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/f/10f32377ac67d94f764f12a15ea987e88c85d3e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\alpha$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" />-tuple <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/8/e5847cf00b5fe50a7d96f4ad83146f4c32ea52c8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A = \\prod_{\\beta &lt; \\alpha} A_{\\beta}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"89\" height=\"40\" /> of totally ordered sets for some <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Ordinal\" title=\"Ordinal\">ordinal</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/f/10f32377ac67d94f764f12a15ea987e88c85d3e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\alpha$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" /> using the strict total orderings <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/0/060f248292f3455957328422a07d5d0746919c85.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$&lt;_{\\beta}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"21\" height=\"15\" /> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/7/47791ec27565bf3f1d06092598f12061fe202e16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A_{\\beta}, \\beta &lt; \\alpha$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"77\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Formal_Definition\">Formal Definition</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Lexicographic_ordering&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Formal Definition\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/1/df1c39ef08875902e1b9b91a69d1907d7f35611c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b) \\in A^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"81\" height=\"19\" />, letting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/2/a62b190dac6928c6691432745a1b3cdc227030b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{\\beta}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"20\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/d/e7d26bc2bb6e9fbb286f3ad21cd4871bf7fd5ac2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b_{\\beta}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"15\" height=\"17\" /> denote the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/1/fd154d1ff689be145542481fd28952d01fdfeecf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\beta^{\\text{th}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"23\" height=\"19\" /> components of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> respectively, we say <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/f/55f8abc0d69ac6ab491f6125f9550af6b25e22fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a &lt; b$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" /> iff <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/1/f51a167e48941e9a2a7cc9f2083c74f2012cf0c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\exists \\gamma \\leq \\alpha)((\\forall \\beta &lt; \\gamma)(a_{\\beta} = b_{\\beta}) \\wedge (a_{\\gamma} &lt;_{\\gamma} b_{\\gamma}))$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"328\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017144919\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.007 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.007 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 58/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2658/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:5855:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017144919 and revision id 20365. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}